# SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-or-later
config RUST_CRED
	bool "Rust task credential lifetime and transitions"
	depends on RUST
	default y
	help
	  Build the task credential lifetime and transitions bodies from kernel/cred.rs in the
	  original kernel/cred.o slot, with native companions for configured
	  primitives, storage and metadata. Turning this option off selects
	  the unchanged original C provider.
